### Submit index task (BUILD_INDEX)
# 文档创建时已自动登记 BUILD_INDEX，此接口用于手动触发；响应 data.taskId 即任务 ID。
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rag/documents/1/index


### Get index task by taskId
# 把路径中的 1 替换为上一步响应里的真实 taskId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rag/index-tasks/1


### List index tasks of document
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rag/documents/1/index-tasks


### Retry a FAILED index task
# 仅当任务状态为 FAILED（status = 4）时可用
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rag/index-tasks/1/retry


### Ask after index built
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": 1,
  "question": "What is the service layer used for?",
  "topK": 5
}
